Package: vetnutriDogR
Type: Package
Title: Canine Nutrition from VetNutri MP INIT Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "VetNutri", family = "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Loads the original VetNutri MP INIT JSON catalogue and Kotlin
    nutrient metadata, calculates canine energy needs and ration intakes, and
    compares them with nutritional reference thresholds. Includes a Shiny
    interface, a Quarto report and independent Kotlin parity tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    shiny,
    knitr
